<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/teibs020"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2009-05-19</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Indikator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Indicator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Saisonbereinigung</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Seasonal adjustment</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Désaisonnalisation</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Confidence indicators by sector</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;Five monthly confidence indicators for the sectors industry, services, retail trade, construction and consumers are produced by the Directorate General for Economic and Financial Affairs (DG ECFIN) of the European Commission to reflect economic perceptions and expectations. The surveys are implemented in the European Union (EU) and in the candidate countries, and addressed to representatives of the industry (manufacturing), services, retail trade and construction sectors, as well as to consumers. Confidence indicators are produced as arithmetic average of the (seasonally adjusted) balances of answers to selected questions chosen from the whole set of questions in each individual survey; balances series are the difference between positive and negative answering options, measured as percentage points of total answers. Monthly confidence indicators are produced monthly at country, EU and euro area level for all sectors but financial services, which covers the EU and the euro area only. Data are seasonally adjusted (SA). For more details on the methods used by DG ECFIN in the computation of confidence indicators, please refer to the user &lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/documents/methodological_guidelines/bcs_user_guide.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;guide&lt;/a&gt; of The Joint Harmonised EU Programme of Business and Consumer Surveys. Source: DG ECFIN&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Indicateur de confiance par secteur</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">&lt;p&gt;Cinq indicateurs de confiance mensuels pour l’industrie, les services, le commerce de détail, la construction et les consommateurs sont produits par la direction générale des affaires économiques et financières (DG ECFIN) de la Commission européenne afin de refléter les perceptions et les attentes économiques. Les enquêtes sont mises en œuvre dans l’Union européenne (UE) et dans les pays candidats, et sont adressées aux représentants de l’industrie (fabrication), des services, du commerce de détail et de la construction, ainsi qu’aux consommateurs. Les indicateurs de confiance sont établis sous la forme d’une moyenne arithmétique des soldes (corrigés des variations saisonnières) des réponses aux questions sélectionnées, choisies dans l’ensemble des questions de chaque enquête; les soldes sont la différence entre les réponses positives et négatives, mesurées en points de pourcentage de réponses totales. Les indicateurs de confiance mensuels sont produits tous les mois, au niveau des pays, au niveau de l’UE et de la zone euro, pour tous les secteurs, sauf pour les services financiers, qui ne sont effectués qu’au niveau de l’UE et la zone euro. Les données sont corrigées des variations saisonnières (SA). Pour de plus amples informations sur les méthodes utilisées par la DG ECFIN dans le calcul des indicateurs de confiance, veuillez consulter le &lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/documents/methodological_guidelines/bcs_user_guide.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;guide&lt;/a&gt; de l’utilisateur du programme commun harmonisé des enquêtes de conjoncture de l’UE. Source: DG ECFIN&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Indikator des Vertrauens in der Industrie nach Sektor</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">&lt;p&gt;Fünf monatliche Vertrauensindikatoren für die Sektoren Industrie, Dienstleistungen, Einzelhandel, Baugewerbe und Verbraucher werden von der Generaldirektion Wirtschaft und Finanzen (GD ECFIN) der Europäischen Kommission erstellt, um die wirtschaftlichen Wahrnehmungen und Erwartungen widerzuspiegeln. Die Erhebungen werden in der Europäischen Union (EU) und in den Beitrittsländern durchgeführt und richten sich an Vertreter der Industrie (verarbeitendes Gewerbe), des Dienstleistungssektors, des Einzelhandels und des Baugewerbes sowie an Verbraucher. Die Konfidenzindikatoren werden als arithmetisches Mittel der (saisonbereinigten) Salden der Antworten auf ausgewählte Fragen ermittelt, die aus dem gesamten Fragenkatalog jeder einzelnen Erhebung ausgewählt wurden. Die Saldenreihen sind die Differenz zwischen positiven und negativen Antwortoptionen, gemessen in Prozentpunkten der Antworten insgesamt. Monatliche Vertrauensindikatoren werden monatlich auf Ebene der Länder, der EU und des Euro-Währungsgebiets für alle Sektoren mit Ausnahme der Finanzdienstleistungen erstellt, die nur die EU und das Euro-Währungsgebiet abdecken. Die Daten sind saisonbereinigt (SA). Weitere Einzelheiten zu den von der GD ECFIN bei der Berechnung der Vertrauensindikatoren verwendeten Methoden finden Sie im &lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/documents/methodological_guidelines/bcs_user_guide.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benutzerhandbuch&lt;/a&gt; des Gemeinsamen Harmonisierten Programms der EU für Konjunkturumfragen unter Unternehmern und Verbrauchern. Quelle: GD ECFIN&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:identifier>teibs020</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibs020"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MNE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MKD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ALB"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SRB"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/TUR"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Indikator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/S_ADJ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Saisonbereinigung</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Seasonal adjustment</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Désaisonnalisation</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC?code=BS-CCI-BAL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Vertrauensindikator im Baugewerbe</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Construction confidence indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Construction, indicateur de confiance</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC?code=BS-CSMCI-BAL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Verbraucher, Vertrauensindikator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Consumer confidence indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Consommateur, indicateur de confiance</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC?code=BS-ICI-BAL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Industrie, Vertrauensindikator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Industrial confidence indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Industrie, indicateur de confiance</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC?code=BS-RCI-BAL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Einzelhandel, Vertrauensindikator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Retail confidence indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Commerce de détail, indicateur de confiance</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC?code=BS-SCI-BAL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Vertrauensindikator im Dienstleistungssektor</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Services confidence indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Services, indicateur de confiance</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">168</stat:numSeries><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-04-29</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-05-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-04-30</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibs020"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibs020</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/ei_bcs_esms.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibs020"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/ei_bcs_esms.htm]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/ei_bcs_esms.sdmx.zip"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) SDMX</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibs020"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/ei_bcs_esms.sdmx.zip]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/xml"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf